<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Delete (254)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>delete &lt;player&gt;
delete self forever
</pre>
<p>Meant to delete a player's character from the player files at once, 
without asking: a fast delete for emergencies. Only gods of level 254 and 
above may delete someone else.
</p><p><b>At present it deletes nothing:</b> it checks that the character exists 
and says "&lt;player&gt; has been deleted.", but the character is left as it 
was (a known bug). Check with <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Wstat</a> or the player files before 
you rely on it.
</p><p>delete self forever deletes your own character, as for any player (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Delete</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Delete</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Ban</a>
</pre>




</div>